# Local voice-cloning TTS service (tts-service/server.py, Coqui XTTS-v2) — the venv is a huge
# (multi-GB) local Python environment that never belongs in git, and voices/*.wav is Patrick's own
# personal voice recording, which stays local to his machine, never committed (see
# tts-service/voices/README.md).
tts-service/venv/
tts-service/voices/*.wav
tts-service/__pycache__/
tts-service/*.pyc
